{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ARxhXrURd5tooFmhVTWt1Q","type":"tool_result","content":"**No.** The page doesn't say whether the module includes CAN transceivers or 120 Ω termination resistors for CAN1 or CAN2. It makes no statements about CAN termination at all.\n\nWhat the page does include:\n\n- **Connectivity:** \"Dual 1 mbit/s CAN bus\" gives the bus count and speed only.\n- **CAN2 pinout:** Pin 73 is CAN2+ and pin 74 is CAN2−, both labeled \"CAN bus 2.\" No other pins are listed for CAN2.\n- **CAN1 pinout (for comparison):** Pin 93 is CAN+ and pin 94 is CAN−, both labeled \"CAN bus 1.\"\n\nTermination and transceiver details would need to come from other documentation, such as the schematics or the base board documentation."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a5d128e-ff0a-47b7-9b33-ea39fb44a264","uuid":"6545d6eb-609c-4cc4-aed9-6442e741fa6b","timestamp":"2026-10-17T00:30:30.954Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":412217,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**No.** The page doesn't say whether the module includes CAN transceivers or 120 Ω termination resistors for CAN1 or CAN2. It makes no statements about CAN termination at all.\n\nWhat the page does include:\n\n- **Connectivity:** \"Dual 1 mbit/s CAN bus\" gives the bus count and speed only.\n- **CAN2 pinout:** Pin 73 is CAN2+ and pin 74 is CAN2−, both labeled \"CAN bus 2.\" No other pins are listed for CAN2.\n- **CAN1 pinout (for comparison):** Pin 93 is CAN+ and pin 94 is CAN−, both labeled \"CAN bus 1.\"\n\nTermination and transceiver details would need to come from other documentation, such as the schematics or the base board documentation.","durationMs":5279,"url":"https://github.com/FOME-Tech/Polygonus"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01ARxhXrURd5tooFmhVTWt1Q","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
