{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wm4mwRcuJWhtgrmjas95ny","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"TLE9201SG datasheet pinout PG-DSO-12 pin 2 \"VSO\" SO DIR PWM DIS\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"12-BSOP; P/PG-DSO-12\",\"url\":\"https://azcus.digikey.com/en/products/detail/infineon-technologies/TLE9201SGAUMA1/5960696\"},{\"title\":\"Infineon is the driver for DC motor control PWM to 20 kHz and maximum current of 7 A\",\"url\":\"https://www.radiolocman.com/news/new.html?di=150800\"},{\"title\":\"Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Bridge with SPI\",\"url\":\"https://www.mouser.pe/infineon-tle9201sg/\"},{\"title\":\"Infineon Technologies Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A SPI搭載Hブリッジ\",\"url\":\"https://www.mouser.jp/infineon-tle9201sg/\"},{\"title\":\"Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Bridge with SPI\",\"url\":\"https://www.mouser.pl/infineon-tle9201sg\"},{\"title\":\"Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Bridge with SPI\",\"url\":\"https://nl.mouser.com/infineon-tle9201sg\"},{\"title\":\"Infineon Technologies Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Brücke mit SPI\",\"url\":\"https://www.mouser.ch/infineon-tle9201sg\"},{\"title\":\"Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Bridge with SPI\",\"url\":\"https://www.mouser.in/en/infineon-tle9201sg/\"},{\"title\":\"12-BSOP; P/PG-DSO-12\",\"url\":\"https://punchouttest.digikey.kr/en/products/detail/infineon-technologies/TLE9201SGAUMA1/6560041\"},{\"title\":\"Infineon Technologies Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Brücke mit SPI\",\"url\":\"https://www.mouser.li/infineon-tle9201sg\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up the pin-level pinout, so I can't confirm what pin 2 is or whether the SO, DIR, PWM, and DIS labels match this package. The results cover the general device and package.\n\n- **Package:** Distributor listings give the package as PG-DSO-12-17, a 12-pin surface-mount part with an exposed pad. Its supply voltage is listed as 5V to 28V, and it is qualified to AEC-Q100.\n- **Control interface:** The Mouser listing says PWM/DIR control reduces the number of PWM capable pins needed on the microcontroller side. Digi-Key lists the interface as PWM and SPI. That suggests the PWM/DIR pins are the drive inputs, but I couldn't confirm the exact pin numbers.\n- **Diagnostics:** It provides extensive diagnosis via SPI or basic error feedback via error flag.\n- **Heat slug:** The package provides excellent thermal capabilities due to its thick copper heat slug.\n\nThe sources disagree on ratings. One says the device is a general-purpose 5 A H bridge, while Mouser calls it a 6A part. Current-limit thresholds are also given as 7A typ. in one source and 8A typ. in another.\n\nFor the pin 2 assignment and the SO/DIR/PWM/DIS mapping, check the pin configuration section of the Infineon TLE9201SG datasheet directly.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a5d128e-ff0a-47b7-9b33-ea39fb44a264","uuid":"63fbce08-04d0-4a48-a134-9732edd1838b","timestamp":"2026-10-17T00:33:00.457Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"TLE9201SG datasheet pinout PG-DSO-12 pin 2 \"VSO\" SO DIR PWM DIS","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01FHPE4iTbFbxYrsipynrFFb","content":[{"title":"12-BSOP; P/PG-DSO-12","url":"https://azcus.digikey.com/en/products/detail/infineon-technologies/TLE9201SGAUMA1/5960696"},{"title":"Infineon is the driver for DC motor control PWM to 20 kHz and maximum current of 7 A","url":"https://www.radiolocman.com/news/new.html?di=150800"},{"title":"Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Bridge with SPI","url":"https://www.mouser.pe/infineon-tle9201sg/"},{"title":"Infineon Technologies Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A SPI搭載Hブリッジ","url":"https://www.mouser.jp/infineon-tle9201sg/"},{"title":"Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Bridge with SPI","url":"https://www.mouser.pl/infineon-tle9201sg"},{"title":"Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Bridge with SPI","url":"https://nl.mouser.com/infineon-tle9201sg"},{"title":"Infineon Technologies Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Brücke mit SPI","url":"https://www.mouser.ch/infineon-tle9201sg"},{"title":"Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Bridge with SPI","url":"https://www.mouser.in/en/infineon-tle9201sg/"},{"title":"12-BSOP; P/PG-DSO-12","url":"https://punchouttest.digikey.kr/en/products/detail/infineon-technologies/TLE9201SGAUMA1/6560041"},{"title":"Infineon Technologies Infineon Technologies TLE9201SG 6A H-Brücke mit SPI","url":"https://www.mouser.li/infineon-tle9201sg"}]},"The search didn't turn up the pin-level pinout, so I can't confirm what pin 2 is or whether the SO, DIR, PWM, and DIS labels match this package. The results cover the general device and package.\n\n- **Package:** Distributor listings give the package as PG-DSO-12-17, a 12-pin surface-mount part with an exposed pad. Its supply voltage is listed as 5V to 28V, and it is qualified to AEC-Q100.\n- **Control interface:** The Mouser listing says PWM/DIR control reduces the number of PWM capable pins needed on the microcontroller side. Digi-Key lists the interface as PWM and SPI. That suggests the PWM/DIR pins are the drive inputs, but I couldn't confirm the exact pin numbers.\n- **Diagnostics:** It provides extensive diagnosis via SPI or basic error feedback via error flag.\n- **Heat slug:** The package provides excellent thermal capabilities due to its thick copper heat slug.\n\nThe sources disagree on ratings. One says the device is a general-purpose 5 A H bridge, while Mouser calls it a 6A part. Current-limit thresholds are also given as 7A typ. in one source and 8A typ. in another.\n\nFor the pin 2 assignment and the SO/DIR/PWM/DIS mapping, check the pin configuration section of the Infineon TLE9201SG datasheet directly."],"durationSeconds":6.003104244999995,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Wm4mwRcuJWhtgrmjas95ny","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason