{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LdnMF9JX5KxM17ssiHVBRk","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"TLE9201SG\" pin configuration \"1\" DIR \"2\" VSO OR \"pin 2\" \"SO\" site:alldatasheet.com OR datasheetspdf pinout table\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"TLE9201SGAUMA1\",\"url\":\"https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/Gate-Drive-ICs_Infineon-Technologies-TLE9201SGAUMA1_C2653438.html\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201SG Datasheet by Infineon Technologies\",\"url\":\"https://www.digikey.com/htmldatasheets/production/1896279/0/0/1/tle9201sg.html\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201SG Symbol, Footprint & 3D Model by Infineon\",\"url\":\"https://www.snapeda.com/parts/TLE9201SG/Infineon/view-part/\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201SG by Infineon Technologies Datasheet\",\"url\":\"https://www.digikey.com/en/htmldatasheets/production/1896279/0/0/1/tle9201sg\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201 Datasheet, PDF - Datasheet Search Engine\",\"url\":\"https://www.alldatasheet.com/view_datasheet.jsp?Searchword=TLE9201\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201 Datasheet, PDF - Alldatasheet\",\"url\":\"https://www.alldatasheet.com/view.jsp?Searchword=TLE9201&sField=2\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201S Datasheet, PDF - Datasheet Search Engine\",\"url\":\"https://www.alldatasheet.com/view_datasheet.jsp?Searchword=TLE9201S&sField=2\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201SG footprint, schematic symbol and 3D model by Infineon\",\"url\":\"https://componentsearchengine.com/part-view/TLE9201SG/Infineon\"},{\"title\":\"TLE9201SG Datasheet(PDF) & Specifications - Infineon - FindIC\",\"url\":\"https://www.findic.us/price/tle9201sg-bQDZoE11e.html\"}]\n\nThe search confirms that pin 1 is DIR and pin 2 is VSO on the TLE9201SG, but it did not surface a pinout table from alldatasheet.com itself.\n\n- **Pin 1 is DIR and pin 2 is VSO.** The Infineon datasheet, hosted on DigiKey, lists pin 1 as the direction input that sets motor current direction, and pin 2 as the supply for the SO output, which is tied to 5V or 3.3V depending on the logic level needed. The pin definitions table lists pin 1 as DIR, the direction input that defines the direction of the motor current, and pin 2 as VSO, the supply pin for the SO output. The same source's top-view diagram shows SO as pin 3 and VS as pin 4.\n- **Alldatasheet pages don't have the pinout.** The alldatasheet.com results only show part metadata: a 1 Mb, 26-page datasheet for the 6 A H-bridge with SPI, dated 2014-02-25 (Rev. 1.0, 2014-02-25). I didn't find a pin table there.\n- **Conflicting third-party data.** One component-search page lists a pin count of 15, which contradicts the 12-pin DSO-12 package shown in other sources, and it mentions an EN pin that the Infineon datasheet doesn't have. I'd treat that page as unreliable and rely on the Infineon datasheet.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a5d128e-ff0a-47b7-9b33-ea39fb44a264","uuid":"0b17f0c1-12d4-46cf-b9dc-dc992c9aa400","timestamp":"2026-10-17T00:33:17.980Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"\"TLE9201SG\" pin configuration \"1\" DIR \"2\" VSO OR \"pin 2\" \"SO\" site:alldatasheet.com OR datasheetspdf pinout table","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01WGD6vbRDCknf1wo6X6LLWs","content":[{"title":"TLE9201SGAUMA1","url":"https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/Gate-Drive-ICs_Infineon-Technologies-TLE9201SGAUMA1_C2653438.html"},{"title":"TLE9201SG Datasheet by Infineon Technologies","url":"https://www.digikey.com/htmldatasheets/production/1896279/0/0/1/tle9201sg.html"},{"title":"TLE9201SG Symbol, Footprint & 3D Model by Infineon","url":"https://www.snapeda.com/parts/TLE9201SG/Infineon/view-part/"},{"title":"TLE9201SG by Infineon Technologies Datasheet","url":"https://www.digikey.com/en/htmldatasheets/production/1896279/0/0/1/tle9201sg"},{"title":"TLE9201 Datasheet, PDF - Datasheet Search Engine","url":"https://www.alldatasheet.com/view_datasheet.jsp?Searchword=TLE9201"},{"title":"TLE9201 Datasheet, PDF - Alldatasheet","url":"https://www.alldatasheet.com/view.jsp?Searchword=TLE9201&sField=2"},{"title":"TLE9201S Datasheet, PDF - Datasheet Search Engine","url":"https://www.alldatasheet.com/view_datasheet.jsp?Searchword=TLE9201S&sField=2"},{"title":"TLE9201SG footprint, schematic symbol and 3D model by Infineon","url":"https://componentsearchengine.com/part-view/TLE9201SG/Infineon"},{"title":"TLE9201SG Datasheet(PDF) & Specifications - Infineon - FindIC","url":"https://www.findic.us/price/tle9201sg-bQDZoE11e.html"}]},"The search confirms that pin 1 is DIR and pin 2 is VSO on the TLE9201SG, but it did not surface a pinout table from alldatasheet.com itself.\n\n- **Pin 1 is DIR and pin 2 is VSO.** The Infineon datasheet, hosted on DigiKey, lists pin 1 as the direction input that sets motor current direction, and pin 2 as the supply for the SO output, which is tied to 5V or 3.3V depending on the logic level needed. The pin definitions table lists pin 1 as DIR, the direction input that defines the direction of the motor current, and pin 2 as VSO, the supply pin for the SO output. The same source's top-view diagram shows SO as pin 3 and VS as pin 4.\n- **Alldatasheet pages don't have the pinout.** The alldatasheet.com results only show part metadata: a 1 Mb, 26-page datasheet for the 6 A H-bridge with SPI, dated 2014-02-25 (Rev. 1.0, 2014-02-25). I didn't find a pin table there.\n- **Conflicting third-party data.** One component-search page lists a pin count of 15, which contradicts the 12-pin DSO-12 package shown in other sources, and it mentions an EN pin that the Infineon datasheet doesn't have. I'd treat that page as unreliable and rely on the Infineon datasheet."],"durationSeconds":6.468063346999989,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LdnMF9JX5KxM17ssiHVBRk","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
